!! gate ~ read

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`read` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a QUERY verb: read cap, no residency mutation and no effect record; the only write lands the bytes in the named host file`>>
```

