<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · outcome-unknown

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.bundle.repacks source/<bundle> from/<bag>]] ~ source= and from= both stand required; a source outside bags/ and wikis/ derives no address`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`outcome-unknown` params=`~ this process stopped waiting after the vessel answered; a short read found no receipt for this attempt's request id; read it back with lares vessel request <id> before any re-run`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

